	</entry>
	<entry>
		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  TopMemoryContext récurrent]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=22106#p22106"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Dommage... <br />Du coups, pour info, si j&#039;ai par exemple:<br /><span style="color: blue">select * from a <strong>inner join</strong> b on a.id=b.id <strong>inner join</strong> c on c.id_a=a.id and c.num&gt;2 where <strong>a.code=&#039;mon code&#039;</strong> and <strong>c.code=&#039;autre code&#039;</strong> order by <strong>a.id</strong></span><br />Je compterai : <br />=&gt; 2 inner join=2 work_mem <br />=&gt; 2 conditions dans le where = 2 work_mem<br />=&gt; 1 order by = 1 work_mem<br />Soit 5 work_mem au total?</p>]]></content>
		<author>
			<name><![CDATA[olivier.bouiron]]></name>
			<uri>http://forums.postgresql.fr/profile.php?id=4987</uri>
